words.js — Armenian word pool
=============================

words.js is a derived work: it is a filtered subset of the base word forms in
the Eastern Armenian spelling dictionary `dictionary-hy`, as published by
wooorm/dictionaries (https://github.com/wooorm/dictionaries), which generates
it from `araktransfer`. That dictionary is tri-licensed:

    GPL 2.0 or later / LGPL 2.1 or later / MPL 1.1 or later

This file is distributed under the Mozilla Public License 1.1 arm of that
tri-license. The full text of MPL 1.1 is available at:

    https://www.mozilla.org/MPL/1.1/

Word selection additionally used frequency data from hermitdave/FrequencyWords
(https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords), MIT licensed, itself derived
from the OpenSubtitles corpus.

